  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p></p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《一等一ê生日禮物》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">曾韻瑄</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh7kU-5cNdgKe13Dn7tUS0vKLdzBYzsG3Xm9BEJkzz0lotIrYlUh25GF6aJkyGtOfR-yHOFVlrR_pPHA0x-WNVgrF-7dTrIgvYyjYE4x7g3xVvimR3qUBmMS7_2LfvP3pPIZbqw_qqS8WUXGYkOehRdBSp0dHn2HDgrTOWvht4nXzJRov8CzxkufGb0RpwP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh7kU-5cNdgKe13Dn7tUS0vKLdzBYzsG3Xm9BEJkzz0lotIrYlUh25GF6aJkyGtOfR-yHOFVlrR_pPHA0x-WNVgrF-7dTrIgvYyjYE4x7g3xVvimR3qUBmMS7_2LfvP3pPIZbqw_qqS8WUXGYkOehRdBSp0dHn2HDgrTOWvht4nXzJRov8CzxkufGb0RpwP=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEifTTZZZpZ0lbqLvUaaSkYbitsswJEANEBNfLW0cCShJmpgP90s-12nRgquTUbnqpKh24N_s5EwFoxdxpMoRjJu9GohfqT48IbmcoulBuTZcurB1afR0enbnBOTj766NSUf3XnGt47K1hew-1KkOROvbwgs_eNLjdXV1UvVTWrFb3UddIgy_LPp6p52iEZR\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEifTTZZZpZ0lbqLvUaaSkYbitsswJEANEBNfLW0cCShJmpgP90s-12nRgquTUbnqpKh24N_s5EwFoxdxpMoRjJu9GohfqT48IbmcoulBuTZcurB1afR0enbnBOTj766NSUf3XnGt47K1hew-1KkOROvbwgs_eNLjdXV1UvVTWrFb3UddIgy_LPp6p52iEZR=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /></div></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阮兜ê姊夫是基督教長老教會ê牧師，為著爸母靈魂ê得救，阿姊是有喙講到無瀾，十外冬ê耐心放送，大姊hām姊夫總算kā阿爸阿母chhōa入去信仰ê世界，70歲開始，chiâⁿ做上帝ê羊仔。Hit工規家伙仔lóng到教會，參加阿爸阿母ê洗禮典禮，真無簡單。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我chit个做小妹--ê，愛súi是厝內底無人比，生囝了後，為著減肥啥mih死人骨頭lóng願意哺--落-去。健身到taⁿ， tih-beh十冬，逐擺ê訓練結束，身軀痠疼，kiōng-beh昏--去。不而過，後--來我ê辛苦有價值，我m̄-nā瘦kah súi-tang-tang，chûn--年，koh開始比健美。無論按怎辛苦kah痠疼，lóng bōe-tàng阻擋我想beh做一隻烏貓ê決心。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">M̄-koh，健身hō͘我上大ê好--處，m̄是kan-ta ē-sái chiâⁿ做「天仙妖精」niâ，koh ài開始過健康ê生活，食、練、睏，ài注意kah齊全，規律ê訓練、原形ê食物、睏眠ê飽tīⁿ，筋肉一工一工訓練ê累積，年久月深，除了愈來愈妖嬌健康，無論ku、跳、走、peh iah是khiú、kōaⁿ、夯、扛，lóng輕輕鬆鬆，bōe輸20歲ê少年囡仔仝款。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">所擺，若是聽著阿母講伊身軀痠疼到無一塊好，我就叫伊去健身房上課，學我攑石碾，避免骨頭hâm-sau，維持筋肉ê力量，學費我kā出，我講kah我喙角專 pho，阿母bōe-giàn去就是bōe-giàn去。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阿母雜唸ê時，真正chiok gâu haiⁿ，我聽著心狂火to̍h就khí-mo͘ bái，iáu-m̄-koh，無法度，伊是阮阿母，ài忍耐。是講逐禮拜聽伊se̍h-se̍h唸，我chih載bōe tiâu，為著我ê耳空kah健康，姑不而將，規氣來宣傳我「肌督教」ê理念，唸倒tńg--去，看kám有效。橫直，去練身體mā是痠，規工tī厝無活動mā是疼，不如試看māi，kā阿母洗腦，無的確有一工伊ē願意去。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">就án-ne，想bōe到chit工hō͘我等--著--ah！</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">本chiâⁿ叫是「火燒罟寮——無漁網（ 希望）」，想bōe到今年tī我生日進前，阿母叫我chhōa伊去健身房，伊beh開始學習hām訓練--ah！Ai-iō，kám是有孝感動天？感謝上帝。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Hit工教練傳阿母ê錄影hō͘--我，我看伊姿勢不止仔標準，果然是練武奇才！阿母注心學，kā我臭屁講：「提兩公斤，無啥重量，bōe忝--lah！無你講ê hiah-nī仔痠疼--lah。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">多謝阿母送我生日禮物，看你認真學，食到老，學到老，為家己ê健康拍拚，做序細--ê chiâⁿ歡喜。因為無啥mi̍h比食老ē-sái sì-kòe pha-pha走koh-khah好ê人生--ah！</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">辛苦一世人ê阿母，ǹg望你走káⁿ-ná飛，活跳跳sì-kòe趖，訓練hō͘勇健，看lán有thang做伙koh去遊覽世界--無。若án-ne，我chit个「肌督教」ê傳教士任務就圓滿--ah！</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX\" style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: large; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"512\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div></span><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: bot